   114	**Chosen: SVG + DOM phase machine (single rAF clock, state function of elapsed ms).** The grid, outlines, disc, ballot box, paper, check path, connector and block wash are all SVG geometry generated from CONFIG — outlines as simplified rectilinear state-block borders (data polygons in CONFIG), cells as generated rects, fill as a wash rect clipped to the block polygon behind the cells. A pure stateAt(ms) function makes every A11 census assertion executable headlessly.
